  - ...
  repeatInspection:
  - Still here! Technically on break. {p}{small}Don't tell my rating.{/small} ||
    The wall's that way. Be nice to it. It's having a rough decade.
  - 'Five-star tip: never deliver on an empty stomach. {p}{fast}I always deliver
    on an empty stomach.{/fast}'
  - I've got forty-two packages in this bag. {p}Forty-one addresses. {p}{small}Don't
    do the math.{/small}
  - Your cat looks at me like I owe him money. {p}...Do I owe him money?
  - You walk like you're carrying boxes. Even when your hands are empty. {p}{small}I
    notice stuff. Occupational hazard.{/small}
  - Hey. {p}Thanks for staying. {p}{fast}Most people take the package and go, which,
    fair, that's the job, but still.{/fast}
  specialInspectionAt: 0
  specialInspection: []
  cycleRepeat: 1
