  - you want to know how i got here? {p}same as everyone. {p}{small}somebody stopped
    thinking about me.{/small} || ...dont look at me like that. its a good gig. free
    rent.
  - my collar shows texts from 2003. {p}nobody i know. {p}i read them anyway. {p}'r
    u up' was big that year.
  - kira talks fast so she doesnt have to hear herself. {p}you talk slow so you dont
    have to say anything. {p}{small}im the only normal one here.{/small}
  - if you get lost, look for the brightest sign and go the other way. {p}{small}thats
    where the good stuff hides.{/small}
  - ...you can pet me. {p}{slow}not because i want it.{/slow} {p}for your mental
    health.
